WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:18.900
[Quiet dive-bar room tone]

00:19.000 --> 00:19.550
[Pool cue strikes; the rack erupts in rapid collisions]

00:19.550 --> 00:20.450
[Balls clack against one another and the rails]

00:20.450 --> 00:21.300
[Two balls drop into pockets amid fading collisions]

00:21.300 --> 00:22.500
[Final rail contacts and ball clicks fade]

00:22.500 --> 00:30.000
[Quiet room tone]
